	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Multis iam mensibus effluxis, humanissime <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, desiderabam te meis licet insulsis litterulis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>alloqui.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Intercepit desiderium illud meum dextre mee im<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>pedimentum, ob quod longo tempore nec elementum unum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>pingere valui.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Verum aliqualiter restitutus, ne fortassis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>suspicionem de me damnabilem tui tuorumque beneficiorum immemoreni <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ac liberalitatis multifarie mihi comunicate oblitum conciperes, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>calamum resumpsi et tibi super beneficiis munificentię<note type="misc">"-centiisque" wollte er vielleicht schreiben</note> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>adeo liberaliter mihi collatis gratias ago immortales.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Verum ingratitudinem meam, qui preter verba super tot ac <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>tantis donis et beneficiis nihil rependo, boni consulas oro <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>mea culpa territus; non cesso ex corde te amare atque <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>meritis et dignitate tuis observare.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Opera, quibus me <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>munifice donasti, magno affectu et diligenter legi ac fruc<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>tum inde, prout dominus gratiam contulit, excerpsi; sunt ex nervis <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>sacre scripture compillationes autore vere digne.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Dominus <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>conatum tuum adiuvet et te eclesie sue incolumem con<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>servet <persName>Nestoriosque</persName> annos attingere disponat.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>De statu anno ętatis mee, qui annum ago 76., te facio <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>certiorem, incomoda carnis ac nature innumeras puncturas <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>condicionesque molestas tentantes carnem in dies fero patienter <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>confisus in domini adiutorium, usque ad praesens tempus ann<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>us <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>integer restat, que ventura supersunt cum spe gratie in fide <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>vera omnipotentis dei misericordie ac disposicioni relinquo.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Eclesia nostra optimo ministro <persName>Ioanne Concio</persName> et vigilantissimo curata <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>in statu tollerabili conservatur; verbum domini sincere praedicatur.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Non <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>cessat antichristus semen suum miscere sine tamen veritatis <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>noxa.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Dominus eam illuminet, foveat et protegat ab omnibus incursi<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>onibus dyabolicis.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Cęterum, collendissime <lb xml:id="p1z31"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, harum <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>latorem <persName>Iacobum a Plantanis</persName>, iuvenem de nobili familia, sed <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>tenuis fortune, qui <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> statuit bonis literis incumbere, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>tibi ex animo commendo.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Si posses ei ea promocione succurrere, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ut ex elemosinis piorum locorum ad pauperum usibus ordinatis <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>iuvaretur, facies opus pium et te dignum, mihi non minus <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>gratum quam affectatum.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis ex me totam familiam tuam cum <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>symistis et fratribus per Christum omnibus.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8432">Fridericus</persName>, gener meus, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>cum tota domo <placeName ref="l93">Clavenne</placeName> bene valet; <persName>Ioannes</persName> suus distractus <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>a studiis literarum maiori affectu fidibus incumbit, quod accep<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>tum ferre non possum.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vive et vale, iucundissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z11"/><persName ref="p6831">Traversumque</persName> tibi devinctum amare perge, qui se tuis ac <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>eclesie <placeName ref="l587">Tigurine</placeName> orationibus ex corde comendat.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Ex Zutz 14. <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>calendas decembres 1559.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z14"/>Quantulus est, deditissimus <lb xml:id="p2z15"/><persName ref="p6831">Ioannes Traversus</persName><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Strenuo verbi dei defensori [int<lb xml:id="p4z2"/>re]pidoque asertori domino <persName ref="p495">Hen[rico B]<lb xml:id="p4z3"/>ullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinorum</placeName> pasto[ri <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>vig]ilantissimo, fratri meo per Christum <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>collen<lb xml:id="p4z6"/>dissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
